%% aoneahsan-cccs-react-api-tanstack-query — full flow
flowchart TD
    trigger([Data needed from a server]) --> how{How is it being fetched?}
    how -->|useEffect + useState| migrate[Migrate to useQuery —<br/>you are hand-rolling caching,<br/>dedup, retry and refetch]
    how -->|stored in zustand| move[Move it. Query owns server data]
    how -->|useQuery| key
    migrate --> key
    move --> key

    key[Query key from a per-domain factory —<br/>never an inline string array]
    key --> deps{Is EVERY value the query<br/>depends on in the key?}
    deps -->|no| addkey[Add it — a missing filter serves<br/>stale results for the WRONG filter]
    deps -->|yes| shape
    addkey --> shape

    shape{Is this a LIST read?}
    shape -->|yes| budget[/🔴 DATA-FETCH BUDGET/]
    budget --> lim{Explicit limit set?}
    lim -->|no| bounded{Structurally bounded<br/>enum-like collection?}
    bounded -->|yes| comment["Allowed — add // bounded: reason"]
    bounded -->|no| bug[THIS IS A BUG. Collections grow.<br/>Default 20, hard max 50.<br/>An unbounded read took production<br/>down for a day]
    bug --> setlimit[Set the limit]
    lim -->|yes| server
    setlimit --> server
    comment --> server

    server{Filtering, sorting<br/>or counting?}
    server -->|filter/sort| serverside[Do it SERVER-side via query + index.<br/>Client-side only within one<br/>already-limited page]
    server -->|count| agg[Aggregation or a counter field.<br/>NEVER read the docs to count them]
    server -->|no| pages
    serverside --> pages
    agg --> pages
    pages{More than one page?}
    pages -->|yes| cursor[Cursor/keyset pagination.<br/>Never offset loops,<br/>never 'load 500 show 20']
    pages -->|no| stale
    cursor --> stale

    shape -->|no, single record| stale
    stale{How often does<br/>this actually change?}
    stale -->|rarely| longstale[staleTime >= 5 min,<br/>refetchOnWindowFocus: false]
    stale -->|must be live| livestale[Short staleTime, or a SCOPED<br/>listener — single doc or limited query,<br/>detached on unmount]

    longstale --> states
    livestale --> states
    states[Render loading, EMPTY and error<br/>as distinct states —<br/>an empty list shown as a spinner<br/>reads as broken]

    states --> mutate{Mutating?}
    mutate -->|yes| invalidate[Invalidate the affected keys.<br/>Do not hand-patch the cache]
    invalidate --> optimistic{Is the latency<br/>actually felt?}
    optimistic -->|yes| snapshot[Optimistic update with an<br/>onMutate snapshot + onError rollback]
    optimistic -->|no| plain[Plain invalidate is enough]
    mutate -->|no| done
    snapshot --> done
    plain --> done
    done([Verified against the budget])

    classDef gateNode fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#d97706,color:#7c2d12
    classDef terminal fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b
    classDef warn fill:#fef2f2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#7f1d1d
    class how,deps,shape,lim,bounded,server,pages,stale,mutate,optimistic gateNode
    class trigger,done terminal
    class bug,budget warn
